    {'padas': ['nicitaṃ khamupetya nīradaiḥ priyahīnā hṛdayāvanīradaiḥ |', 'salilairnihitaṃ rajaḥ kṣitau ravicandrāvapi nopalakṣitau'], 'num': '|| 1 ||', 'gloss': 'The sky is packed with clouds that have come up — clouds that tear the soil of the hearts of women parted from their lovers; the earth’s dust is laid by the waters, and neither sun nor moon can be seen.'},
