    {'padas': ['nīlaśasyamabhibhāti komalaṃ', "vāri vindati ca cātako'malam |", 'ambudaiḥ śikhigaṇo vinādyate', 'kā ratirdayitayā vinādya te'], 'num': '|| 10 ||', 'gloss': 'The tender green crops shine, the cātaka finds pure water, the clouds make the flocks of peacocks cry out — what pleasure can you have today without your beloved?'},
